# Architecture Rules

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## MUST

- Keep viewer-request handler CPU-only (no fetch, AWS SDK, or fs I/O)
- Use CloudFront `uri` + `querystring` separately
- Preserve HTTPS apex→www redirect behavior
- Handle malformed URIs without throwing
- Keep webpack bundle minimal (no production dependencies)

## MUST NOT

- Parse query strings out of `uri`
- Use Node `path.normalize` for URL paths
- Expand IAM or CF exports casually — human review required
- Commit build output (`dist/`) as source of truth
